  "description": "Golden vectors for the accounts-hash preimage. Hand-authored and generated by a third implementation, so neither the program nor either SDK is its own oracle. The preimage is, for each compact instruction in order: the program id account, then each referenced account, each contributing its 32-byte key followed by one flags byte (bit0 = is_signer, bit1 = is_writable). Index bytes carry a forward-signer request in bit 7 which is masked off before lookup. The hash is SHA-256 of that preimage.",
